TEXT 40 432 Left 2 !.tran 0 110m 50m 10u
TEXT 40 472 Left 2 !.model DI_1N4004 D (IS=76.9p \n+ RS=42.0m BV=400 IBV=5.00u \n+ CJO=39.8p M=0.333 N=1.45 \n+ TT=4.32u)
